    {
      "text": "not a God that hath pleasure in wickedness, Ps. 5:4. hath pleasure in the prosperity of his servant, Ps. 35:27. Do good in thy good pleasure unto Zion, Ps. 51:18. Lord taketh pleasure in them that fear him, Ps. 147:11. He that loveth pleasure shall be a poor man, Prov. 21:17. enjoy pleasure … this also is vanity, Eccl. 2:1. he hath no pleasure in fools, Eccl. 5:4. pleasure of the Lord shall prosper, Isa. 53:10 (Mosiah 14:10). in the day of your fast ye find pleasure, Isa. 58:3. Have I any pleasure at all that the wicked should die, Ezek. 18:23.",
